<div class="weed-ai">
  <h4>Activity 17: AI in the Field</h4>
  <p class="weed-ai__prompt">AI can be used with drones to detect, classify, and quantify weeds in a field. Looking at this image and trying to locate the weeds, determine their species, and count the number of weeds will take hours. AI can memorize many weed types and save you time.</p>

  <img src="/WIAA/images/weeds_in_field.jpg" alt="Weeds in a field" style="max-width: 800px; width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; margin: 20px auto;" />

  <div class="weed-ai__item">
    <label>Which AI tool can be used to identify weeds?</label>
    <textarea rows="2" placeholder="Type your answer here..."></textarea>
  </div>
  <div class="weed-ai__item">
    <label>Which AI tool can be used to count weeds?</label>
    <textarea rows="2" placeholder="Type your answer here..."></textarea>
  </div>
  <div class="weed-ai__item">
    <label>A satellite flies over a field and collects 12 images. Each image contains 20 million pixels. For each pixel, the NDVI value must be calculated to determine the health of the field. How can AI help in this situation?</label>
    <textarea rows="3" placeholder="Type your answer here..."></textarea>
  </div>
</div>

